# Integrity-sealed glass-brain outline artifacts. Pin them so git never applies
# end-of-line normalization on any platform checkout; otherwise the SHA-256
# manifest verified in tests/testthat/test-eeg-vis-glassbrain.R would break on
# the r-universe build matrix (e.g. a CRLF checkout of the .dcf on Windows).
inst/extdata/glassbrain_outline.rds     binary
inst/extdata/glassbrain_outline.dcf     -text
inst/extdata/glassbrain_outline.sha256  -text
